mysqlnd: the MySQL Native Driver, the client library of mysqli and
pdo_mysql in PHP itself (no libmysqlclient), with SSL on the OpenSSL
and the compressed protocol on the zlib of the base system. A module of
its own here (a part of the core in the official lang/php81).

The module mysqlnd of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/mysqlnd.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its
headers in include/php81/php/ext/mysqlnd.
